 # agent-desktop
+
+> Native adaptation, 2026-11-15: scope and invocation guidance adapted for the shared toolkit. Read [native bindings](NATIVE-BINDINGS.md) first, then the complete upstream method below. Original source, unchanged support and replayable diff are recorded in [SOURCE.json](SOURCE.json).
 
 agent-desktop is a CLI that reads and operates desktop apps through the OS accessibility tree. Every command prints one JSON envelope (`ok`, `data` or `error`). It is a tool, not an agent: the observe, act and verify loop runs in you.
 
